cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its outputs in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "HHS UAC Forecasting Dashboard: Operational Analytics and Hybrid Time-Series Forecasting for the Unaccompanied Alien Children Program"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end data analytics and forecasting framework for the U.S. Department
  of Health and Human Services Unaccompanied Alien Children (UAC) Program.
  The pipeline ingests publicly released daily counts across the CBP intake to
  HHS discharge pipeline, computes operational KPIs (pressure index, stability
  score, bottleneck classification, cumulative backlog), and produces 30-day
  forecasts using two complementary approaches: Facebook Prophet for
  interpretable seasonal decomposition and a tuned Random Forest / XGBoost
  ensemble with GridSearchCV and TimeSeriesSplit cross-validation. The system
  is deployed as an interactive Streamlit dashboard with filters, gauges, and
  downloadable outputs.
